1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Point Forge at an OpenAPI spec. Agent tools, an MCP server, SDKs, docs — generated. One command.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Share it through the rysh upstream; a teammate subscribes.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Their agent now calls your localhost API — only op-name and arguments cross the wire; the HTTP call runs on your machine.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,500
Mutations? Denied by default.

5
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,000
Your API. Never public. rysh dot A I.

